Predicts what the NVDA screen reader would say, built on NVDA's open-source
code. Not affiliated with NV Access.

This package contains none of that code. The runtime that holds it is a
separate download (`npx foresay install`), licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later,
and its licence text, source offer and notices are in the bundle it unpacks
(LICENSE and NOTICES). This package starts that runtime as a separate program
and exchanges JSON lines with it; it copies no file out of the runtime and
rewrites none.

"NVDA" is named here only to say what is predicted. This package does not
use the NVDA logo.
